   - FeatureProvider

2. Added Suspense and ErrorBoundary components for better error handling and loading states

3. Added a QueryClient instance with some sensible defaults

4. Implemented a basic ErrorBoundary component to catch and handle any rendering errors

5. Wrapped the ImportedComponent with all these providers in the correct order as shown in the component stack

This should resolve the module fetching error by providing all the necessary context providers that the component needs to render properly. The error boundary will also help catch and handle any other potential errors that might occur during rendering.

